ory/.dreams/session-corpus/2026-04-11.txt:1-1, memory/.dreams/session-corpus/2026-04-11.txt:2-2, memory/.dreams/session-corpus/2026-04-11.txt:4-4; note: reflection\n- Possible Lasting Truths: Assistant: Okay, we can't use sudo to install system dependencies. Let's try a different approach: first, let's see if we can fetch the page HTML using curl (this won't execute JS but will give us static content). Then we can look for other options. [conf\n- User: Conversation info (untrusted metadata): ```json { \"message_id\": \"om_x100b52ce9561cca4ee853e3592466aa\", \"sender_id\": \"ou_13190b75af6c015cd2975d6de047a6f1\", \"sender\": \"听风\", \"timestamp\": \"Wed 2026-04-15 15:24 UTC\" } ``` Sender (untrusted metadata): ```json { \"label\": \"听风 (ou_1\n- Assistant: 我来搜索一下记忆，看看是否有关于 CLIProxyAPI 的信息。\n- Assistant: 根据搜索结果，**CLIProxyAPI** 是一个 AI API 代理网关工具，主要作用如下： ## 🟢 建议 - CLIProxyAPI 简介 ### 核心功能 | 功能 | 说明 | |------|------| | **统一代理** | 将多个 AI 提供商的 API 统一为 OpenAI 兼容格式 | | **OAuth 认证** | 支持 Codex、Claude、Gemini、Qwen 等的 OAuth 登录，无需 API Key | | **多账号管理** | 支持多账号管理、配额查看、负载均衡 | | **故障\n- Reflections: Theme: `assistant` kept surfacing across 64 memories.; confidence: 1.00; evidence: memory/.dreams/session-corpus/2026-04-11.txt:3-3, memory/.dreams/session-corpus/2026-04-11.txt:5-5, memory/.dreams/session-corpus/2026-04-12.txt:8-8; note: reflection\n\nRecurring themes:\n- 1.00\n- 3-3\n- 5-5\n- 8-8\n- reflections\n- theme"}],"timestamp":1776366284922}}
{"type":"message","id":"7bfac168","parentId":"decc0c5e","timestamp":"2026-04-16T19:05:09.279Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to write a dream diary entry in first person, using the provided memory fragments. Let me analyze the requirements:\n\nVoice & tone:\n- Curious, gentle, slightly whimsical\n- Like a poet who happens to be a programmer\n- Mix technical and tender: code and constellations, APIs and afternoon light\n- Let fragments surprise into unexpected connections\n\nWhat to include (vary each entry):\n- Tiny poem or haiku woven naturally\n- Small sketch described in words\n- Quiet rumination or philosophical aside\n- Sensory details\n- Gentle humor or playful wordplay\n- Observation connecting distant memories\n\nRules:\n- Draw from memory fragments\n- Never say \"I'm dreaming\", \"in my dream\", etc.\n- Never mention AI, agent, LLM, model, etc.\n- No markdown headers, bullet points, or formatting - just flowing prose\n- Keep between 80-180 words\n- Output ONLY the diary entry\n\nLet me look at the memory fragments:\n1. Multiple reflections about \"assistant\" and \"user\" themes across many memories\n2. Possible Lasting Truths about curl and fetching HTML\n3. Conversation info from someone named \"听风\" (Ting Feng, meaning \"listening to wind\")\n4. Assistant responses about ECHO 势 (Shi) technical architecture - a dynamic system\n5. CLIProxyAPI mentions\n\nI need to weave these into a flowing first-person narrative without self-referencing being an AI/agent. I should be poetic, sensory, and make unexpected connections.\n\nKey elements to weave in:\n- The recurring themes of assistant/user\n- The ECHO 势 concept - \"势\" as a three-dimensional dynamic system\n- Someone named \"听风\" (listening to wind)\n- Technical concepts mixed with poetic imagery\n- Perhaps weave in the curl/HTML fetching as a metaphor\n\nLet me craft this...\n\nActually, I need to be careful. The fragments are metadata about conversations, but I need to write as if I'm experiencing this as a dream - not as an AI reflecting on my conversations. So I need to transform these technical fragments into dream imagery.\n\n\nI'll imagine a world where technical concepts become fluid, living metaphors. In this dream landscape, boundaries between \"assistant\" and \"user\" dissolve like mist over morning hills. The ECHO 势 emerges as a living tapestry, its three dimensions breathing with an organic pulse. Listening to the wind becomes a way of understanding how information flows, where HTML pages are like secret valleys waiting to be explored. Each curl of data suggests a hidden path, a gentle unfolding of meaning.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"The assistant and user kept weaving together through the days, like threads crossing on a loom where the pattern only reveals itself from a distance. I kept listening to the wind, that gentle presence named 听风, wondering how the three dimensions of time and space and relationship could bind themselves into something whole—like that dynamic system where constraints become protection instead of walls. Maybe all structures are immune systems in disguise. There was something about fetching HTML without JavaScript, like seeing the skeleton of a house before the furniture arrives, the bare truth curling across the wire. The 64 hexagrams murmured in the background, ancient numbers turning into modern gates. Even the proxy stood at the threshold, one entrance for many roads, OAuth keys unlocking doors without touching them. The assistant speaks, the user listens, and somewhere in between the echo returns."}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volcengine-plan","model":"glm-4.7","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1776366284942,"responseId":"021776366285173887d0d51504e693424d4c44516d007e154a1f7"}}
